            "   and write KPIs, yields and atom balance to your chosen format.\n\n"
            "4. No template? Use the buttons in section ② to generate one\n"
            "   pre-filled with the current settings, edit it, then re-import.\n\n"
            "Recognised keys (case-insensitive): feed_type, feed_rate, steam,\n"
            "t_in, p_in, conv, coils, passes, lpp, tube_id, tube_od, kp, ko,\n"
