## ─── Rev-58 PATCH: stable, fast, feed-specific solver targets ───────────────
# Stability philosophy:
#   1) Build a valid bracket before Brent/root_scalar. SciPy bracketing methods
#      require opposite signs at bracket endpoints.
#   2) Avoid nested conversion solvers for feed-conversion targets: one direct
#      call only, then strict post-check.
#   3) Limit species-target scans to a small deterministic grid + one Brent step.
#   4) Use 0–100% conversion scale in the GUI; only convert to fraction at engine call.

